<%
def url(page, params = nil)
  @base_url + "?page=" + page + (params ? "&#{params}" : "")
end

zone = @object
-%>
Hi <%= @user.login %>,

<% if @event.action_state['dns_secondary_missing_primary_closure_reason'] == 'configuration_restored' -%>
a primary server is configured again for DNS zone <%= zone.name %>.
Transfer readiness remains pending until checks of the configured paths
succeed. Restoring the configuration does not by itself confirm a successful transfer.
<% else -%>
DNS zone <%= zone.name %> is no longer enabled as an external secondary
zone, so its missing-primary incident has been closed. This does not confirm
a successful transfer or restored primary reachability.
<% end -%>

You can view the zone in vpsAdmin:

  <%= url('dns', "action=zone_show&id=#{zone.id}") %>

Best regards,

vpsFree.cz team

